5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about who will actually stand in the room when the lights go up.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Staffing is a variable, not a constant. I prefer looking at the physical constraints first.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,Let’s not ignore the people who walk through the doors. Their voices matter most.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,The floor has limits. I need to know what the structure can actually hold.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I always wonder where the money goes before the season even starts.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Misaki, the floor is important, but the hands that build it are more fragile.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,Fragility is a risk we can price. I will check the conservation backlog.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Shion, pricing risk is good, but I want to hear what visitors actually said.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I will look at the structural survey and the maintenance logs for powered displays.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,I’m going to check the loan transport costs and the mount-making charges.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look into the volunteer roster and the conservation lab staffing.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,Agreed. The lab backlog tells us where the real delays hide.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I’ll take the visitor comment slips and the weekend head counts.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,The maintenance log will show if the powered displays are failing quietly.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"If I know the transport and mount costs, I can see the hidden leaks.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,Thank you all. Let’s see what the numbers and the people tell us.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shion,,"The data will be cold, but it will be honest.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,I hope the comments are as honest as the data.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I just need to know if the room can survive the next season.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I just need to know if the budget can survive the next season.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
